 ### Cone Traced Reflections
-Uses the same cone tracing technique as diffuse GI but adjusts step size based on surface roughness. Rough surfaces use larger cones (like diffuse), while smooth surfaces keep mip levels minimal. Separate voxel data for diffuse and specular is recommended, potentially with alternating update frequencies [S35, unofficial].
